      "writtenOn": "2021-05-24T12:57:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Fundamentally, it changed because this change will only provide the boot image files (art/oat/vdex) if the rules to create them are produced and the latter are only produced for the APEX specific variants.\n\nWith that change this test failed because the actual set of files provided was empty.\n\nPreviously, the test was checking the wrong variant, the platform/default APEX variant instead of the APEX specific variant. The latter was not created because the art-bootclasspath-fragment was not added to the apex.\n\nSo, in order to fix this test the fragment had to be added to the APEX and the variant changed to use APEX specific variant.",
      "parentUuid": "c4f444fd_02ec063b",
